From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 22:55:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] [grid] bathymetry = "GLORYS": GLORYS's own sea floor on the
 model grid; 50-level test run

The model's ETOPO sea floor differs from GLORYS's at Fram and the BSO, so the sections and sills
that set the gateway transports differ. glorys_bathymetry.jl (adapted from the port) regrids
GLORYS's deptho with the same steps as regrid_bathymetry.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AbhhvncDb1PnxFVHRBrPRS
